Title: THE COLD CALL
Credit: written by
Author: Storyboard AI Rapid Benchmark
Notes: 1-Minute Micro Demo (1 Scene, 2 Characters, 3 Key Shots)

INT. AIRPORT LOUNGE - NIGHT

Rain drums against floor-to-ceiling panoramic glass. Flight display boards flicker with cancellations.

BENNETT (50s, tailored overcoat, leather attache case) sits alone with an untouched scotch. His burner phone VIBRATES once.

BENNETT
(answering without greeting)
Is it done?

CALLER (O.S.)
(distorted digital voice)
The package is on the 9:15 flight to Geneva. You have ten minutes to board before the gates seal.

Bennett closes the phone, removes the SIM card, drops it into his glass of scotch, and stands up.
